428	     * Whether this owner was flagged at creation as approaching the per-city capacity limit: its city
429	     * already held between 40 and 49 owners (inclusive) at the moment this owner was created, close to
430	     * the hard limit of 50. The owner is still created; this flag is advisory.
431	     */
