362	    /**
363	     * The fiscal year a {@code date} falls in, identified by its ending calendar year. The fiscal
364	     * year starts on 1 July, so dates on or after 1 July belong to the following year's fiscal year
365	     * (e.g. 1 July 2026 is fiscal year 2027), while dates from 1 January to 30 June belong to the
366	     * current year's fiscal year.
